(1119,'d820','School education',2,'d8','d','d8','Gaining admission to school, Education, engaging in all school-related responsibilities and privileges, and learning the course material, subjects and other curriculum requirements in a primary or secondary education programme, including attending school regularly, working cooperatively with other students, taking direction from teachers, organizing, studying and completing assigned tasks and projects, and advancing to other stages of education.',false),
(1120,'d825','Vocational training',2,'d8','d','d8','Engaging in all activities of a vocational programme and learning the curriculum material in preparation for employment in a trade, job or profession.',false),
(1121,'d830','Higher education',2,'d8','d','d8','Engaging in the activities of advanced educational programmes in universities, colleges and professional schools and learning all aspects of the curriculum required for degrees, diplomas, certificates and other accreditations, such as completing a university bachelor''s or master''s course of study, medical school or other professional school.',false),
